ORDERS ["Take Tinker's Plating from the pending offer.","Defend the claim from the east warning and fire the rig blast into the densest group whenever ready.","Pan the nearest active gold seam between threats; retreat to the claim before each horn.","At 25 gold, build a sentry beacon east of the claim covering the approach.","At 40 gold, build a sluice beside the river near the center ford.","After the sluice, save for a turret and build it beside the eastern sentry with clear line of sight.","Add palisades to funnel east, north, south, and west attackers through beacon and turret fire; keep the center ford controlled.","Prioritize surviving attackers, then thieves, wreckers, and the Baron's Rocket Cart.","Before wave 20, field multiple turrets and sentry beacons around the claim, with palisades forcing the Baron into overlapping fire."]
