ORDERS ["Take Pan Like a Legend from the pending offer.","Keep the hero near the claim and avoid contact until health recovers.","At 10 gold, BUILD a palisade on the north approach to the claim.","At 25 gold, BUILD a sentry_beacon covering the claim and north approach.","At 40 gold, BUILD a sluice beside the river near the center ford.","After that, prioritize a turret covering the center ford, then add palisades to funnel all approaches through its line of sight.","Preserve enough gold to strengthen the claim before wave 20; focus all fire on the Baron's Rocket Cart when it appears."]
